# omoikane-gate environment (issue #104 slice G3, E2E prep).
#
# Copy to deploy/gateway.env and fill in. gateway.env is git-ignored
# (*.env in .gitignore); THIS .example file is committed as the template.
# Names must match internal/gate/runtime/config.go exactly.
# Full meanings: docs/gateway-runbook.md.

# --- Required ---------------------------------------------------------

# The opencrab core's Unix socket path.
#   provided by opencrab at compose-confirmation time
# In the container deployment this is the in-container mount path inside
# the shared named volume (see deploy/omoikane-gate.compose.yml); set the
# SAME path on the core container. Empty ⇒ the gate refuses to start.
OPENCRAB_GATE_SOCKET=/run/opencrab/core.sock

# Gateway-scoped omoikane API bearer token.
#   provided by opencrab at compose-confirmation time
# Minted operator-side with the omoikane admin CLI: scope "gateway",
# issued USER-LESS (user_id empty). Never commit the real value.
GATEWAY_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_GATEWAY_SCOPED_USERLESS_TOKEN

# omoikane API base URL, scheme://host (no trailing slash needed).
# Under the compose fragment the kb-server service default is:
KB_BASE_URL=http://kb-server:8080

# --- Optional (defaults shown; uncomment to override) -----------------

# How often the librarian roster is re-polled (positive Go duration).
#GATE_DISCOVERY_INTERVAL=60s

# Reconnect backoff lower bound (positive Go duration).
#GATE_RECONNECT_MIN=1s

# Reconnect backoff upper bound (positive Go duration; must be >= min).
#GATE_RECONNECT_MAX=60s

# Active config revision presented in the hello frame (positive integer).
# Leave at 1 unless a future revision flow appears.
#GATE_HELLO_REVISION=1

# GATE_STATIC_INSTANCES exists ONLY for wire-conformance testing
# (docs/gateway-runbook.md, "conformance 静的モード"): it runs the gate
# with NO KB and every say rejected. NEVER set it in a real deployment.
